{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドルでしたー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まねきケチャさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/29/7901959/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮内凛さん、中川美優さん、松下玲緒菜さん、藤川千愛さん、藤咲真有香さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大好きなアイドルさんに\nカナヲやってひかれる件ね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもね\nカナヲは素でした たぶん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"愛は隠しきれない` ･ω･ ´"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Party Rockets GTさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/29/7901959/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"堀尾歩未さん、菊地史夏さん、吉木悠佳さん、新谷姫加さん、守永七彩さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"物販とか行ったことなかったから\n初めて近くで見たんだけども\nすごく可愛かった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/29/7901959/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新体制 見に行かなきゃ！\n中田も現場で弾丸ハイジャンプしたい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、まいまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめん\n写メ撮ってないのよお"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/29/7901959/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回も言うけど\nひめちゃんもまいまいも\nほんと好きだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただただ楽しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はいつも以上にコメント多く感じました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/29/7901959/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3年もやらせていただけるなんてね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝しかない"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、\n向上しない事への申し訳なさもあるけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生ドルすごくすごく好き。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Pigoo、タイムシフトで見るかたは\nお楽しみにね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2016/03/29/7901959/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}